*** Test Cases ***
### SA
[1] CB008940-D_3-ET1D_Handover_procedure
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the configuration ${D_3-ET1D} $(VENDOR_CTXT_1} ${dict_settings_all_ues}
    ...     Actions:        it performs the call setup for multi-ues on different cells with DL traffic then HO's to target cell
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        call for multi ues and ho are passed
    
    TC 8940 Call Setup Multi Ues With Traffic And Intra Gnb Ho    ${D_3-ET1D}    ${VENDOR_CUSTOM_1}    ${dict_settings_all_ues}    ${CAPTURE_OFF}
    [Teardown]    Run Keyword If Test Failed    Setup.Test Teardown


[1]CB008940-D_2-ET1D_Interaction_with_CB008847_enabled
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the configuration ${D_3-ET1D} $(VENDOR_CTXT_2) ${dict_settings_8_ues}
    ...     Actions:        it performs the call setup for multi-ues on different cells with DL traffic
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        call for multi ues and ho are passed
    
    #vbo# Disabling handover for this test.
    ${D_3-ET1D.NbOfHo}      Set Variable        0
    TC 8940 Call Setup Multi Ues With Traffic And Interaction    ${D_3-ET1D}    ${VENDOR_CUSTOM_2}    ${dict_settings_8_ues}    ${CAPTURE_OFF}
    [Teardown]    Run Keyword If Test Failed    Setup.Test Teardown
